替换现有安装？

English:
Game already installed

Installed version: {installedVer}
Selected PKG: {selectedVer}

Replace the existing installation?

Chinese:
将 {total} 个 PKG 移动到以下目录的子文件夹中：

{fbd.SelectedPath}

分组依据：{moveByLabel}

会创建一个合并的「Base + Update」主文件夹（按标题分组）和一个「Addon」主文件夹（按 Title ID 分组）。

继续？

将 {total} 个 PKG 移动到以下目录的子文件夹中：

{fbd.SelectedPath}

分组依据：{moveByLabel}

继续？

English:
Move {total} PKG(s) into subfolders under:

{fbd.SelectedPath}

Grouped by: {moveBy}

A combined "Base + Update" main folder (grouped by title) and an "Addon" main folder (grouped by Title ID) are created.

Proceed?

Move {total} PKG(s) into subfolders under:

{fbd.SelectedPath}

Grouped by: {moveBy}

Proceed?

